OL,3,ABumble shares soar after report dating
OL,4,Afirm in $1bn takeover talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FShares in dating app company Bumble
OL,7,Fsoared by almost 50% on Monday after a
OL,8,Freport that it is in advanced talks to
OL,9,Fbe bought for around $1bn (#757m).
OL,11,FTechnology holding company Ithaca could
OL,12,Fannounce a deal to buy the Texas-based
OL,13,Ffirm as early as this week, according
OL,14,Fto the Wall Street Journal.
OL,16,FThe jump in Bumble's shares pushed its
OL,17,Fstock market valuation to over $580m
OL,18,Fbut that is still far below a peak of
OL,19,Fmore than $14bn it reached after
OL,20,Flisting on the Nasdaq in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
