OL,3,ABumble shares soar after report dating
OL,4,Afirm in $1bn takeover talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FBumble is one of the world's most
OL,7,Fdownloaded dating apps, operating in a
OL,8,Fcrowded market where growth has slowed.
OL,9,FThe BBC has contacted Bumble and Ithaca
OL,10,Ffor comment.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
