OL,3,ABreaking Bad actor RJ Mitte dies aged
OL,4,A34
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS actor RJ Mitte, best known for his
OL,7,Frole as the defiant son of drug kingpin
OL,8,FWalter White in the drama series
OL,9,FBreaking Bad, has died aged 34.
OL,11,F"It is with profound sadness that we
OL,12,Fshare the tragic passing of beloved
OL,13,Factor, philanthropist, and passionate
OL,14,Fdisability rights advocate RJ Mitte,"
OL,15,Fhis representative told the BBC.
OL,17,FHe died in Brownsville, Texas. No
OL,18,Fimmediate cause of death was provided.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
