OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABreaking Bad actor RJ Mitte dies aged
OL,4,A34
OL,5,
OL,6,FMitte, who lived with cerebral palsy,
OL,7,Fdrew on his own experience for his role
OL,8,Fas Walter White Jr in the Emmy-winning
OL,9,Fdrama series starring Bryan Cranston
OL,10,Fand Aaron Paul. He earned a Screen
OL,11,FActors Guild Award in 2014 for his work
OL,12,Fon the series.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
