OL,3,AUS actress Selma Blair accused of
OL,4,Aassault after incident with flight
OL,5,Aattendants
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS actress Selma Blair has been issued
OL,8,Fwith a summons accusing her of assault
OL,9,Fafter she allegedly attacked attendants
OL,10,Fon a plane, officials say.
OL,12,FThe Legally Blonde star was
OL,13,Finvestigated by the FBI following an
OL,14,Falleged altercation on a Delta Air
OL,15,FLines flight from Los Angeles to New
OL,16,FYork.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
